---

### Answer
**Best Hub**: Al Kharid (warriors, Zeke's scimitars, all in one spot).
**Safe Routes**: North via roads to Varrock; never cut through fields.
**Danger Zone**: Draynor south bank (dark wizards, lethal at low Defence - north approach only).
**Prayer Hub**: West Edgeville Monastery (bone burial, free robes, 2 min from dungeon).
**Shop Hub**: Varrock center (swordshop, armour, runes, archery all clustered).

